#: ../../library/imu.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`imu` --- IMU helper for the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense"
msgstr ":mod:`imu` --- IMU pomoćnik za Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:10
msgid ""
"This page documents the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense's Python ``imu`` module (a"
" small wrapper around the on-board IMU drivers). For the OpenMV C-level "
"``imu`` module that ships on the OPENMV_N6, OPENMV_RT1060, and OPENMV_AE3 "
"camera boards, see :doc:`omv.imu`."
msgstr ""
"Ova stranica dokumentira Python ``imu`` modul Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense "
"(mali omotač oko ugrađenih IMU upravljačkih programa). Za OpenMV ``imu`` "
"modul na razini C koji se isporučuje na OPENMV_N6, OPENMV_RT1060 i "
"OPENMV_AE3 kamerama, pogledajte :doc:`omv.imu`\\ ."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:15
msgid ""
"This module is a thin board-specific wrapper that exposes the on-board "
"inertial measurement unit of the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense as a single "
":py:class:`~imu.IMU` object. Both hardware revisions of the board are "
"handled transparently:"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul je tanki omotač specifičan za ploču koji izlaže ugrađenu "
"inercijsku mjernu jedinicu Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense kao jedan "
":py:class:`~imu.IMU` objekt. Obje hardverske revizije ploče obrađuju se "
"transparentno:"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:20
msgid "**Rev 1** uses a single LSM9DS1 9-axis IMU."
msgstr "**Rev 1** koristi jedan LSM9DS1 9-osni IMU."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Rev 2** combines a Bosch BMI270 (accelerometer + gyroscope) with a Bosch "
"BMM150 magnetometer."
msgstr ""
"**Rev 2** kombinira Bosch BMI270 (akcelerometar + žiroskop) s Bosch BMM150 "
"magnetometrom."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:24
msgid ""
"The constructor probes the I2C bus for the BMI270 address (``0x68``) and "
"selects the matching driver automatically, so user code can be written once "
"and run on either revision."
msgstr ""
"Konstruktor ispituje I2C sabirnicu za BMI270 adresu (\\ ``0x68``\\ ) i "
"automatski odabire odgovarajući upravljački program, tako da se korisnički "
"kod može napisati jednom i pokrenuti na bilo kojoj reviziji."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:28
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Primjer::"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:45
msgid "class IMU"
msgstr "class IMU"

#: ../../library/imu.rst:49
msgid "Construct an IMU object bound to an I2C bus."
msgstr "Stvara IMU objekt vezan na I2C sabirnicu."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:51
msgid ""
"*bus* is an initialised :py:class:`machine.I2C` instance connected to the "
"on-board IMU(s)."
msgstr ""
"*bus* je inicijalizirana :py:class:`machine.I2C` instanca povezana s "
"ugrađenim IMU jedinicama."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:54
msgid ""
"On construction the bus is scanned: if a device responds at address ``0x68``"
" a `BMI270` plus `BMM150` pair is instantiated (Nano 33 BLE Sense Rev 2), "
"otherwise an `LSM9DS1` is instantiated (Rev 1). The underlying driver is "
"kept on the ``imu`` attribute and configured with default ranges and output "
"data rates."
msgstr ""
"Pri stvaranju se skenira sabirnica: ako uređaj odgovori na adresi ``0x68`` "
"stvara se par `BMI270` i `BMM150` (Nano 33 BLE Sense Rev 2), u suprotnom se "
"stvara `LSM9DS1` (Rev 1). Osnovni upravljački program čuva se u ``imu`` "
"atributu i konfigurira se sa zadanim rasponima i izlaznim brzinama podataka."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:62
msgid ""
"Return the latest accelerometer reading as an ``(x, y, z)`` tuple in units "
"of *g* (standard gravities)."
msgstr ""
"Vraća najnovije očitanje akcelerometra kao ``(x, y, z)`` n-torku u "
"jedinicama *g* (standardne gravitacije)."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:67
msgid ""
"Return the latest gyroscope reading as an ``(x, y, z)`` tuple in degrees per"
" second."
msgstr ""
"Vraća najnovije očitanje žiroskopa kao ``(x, y, z)`` n-torku u stupnjevima "
"po sekundi."

#: ../../library/imu.rst:72
msgid ""
"Return the latest magnetometer reading as an ``(x, y, z)`` tuple in micro-"
"tesla (uT)."
msgstr ""
"Vraća najnovije očitanje magnetometra kao ``(x, y, z)`` n-torku u "
"mikroteslama (uT)."
